{
  "_doc": [
    "Shared recurrence vectors (web-revamp spec D4). One algorithm, three readers: the phone's app/src/main/java/com/kevin/legion/notes/Recurrence.kt (the reference), server/api/recurrence.py (tests/test_recurrence.py) and the web's src/lib/recurrence.ts.",
    "Each vector is transcribed from the Kotlin test it names, its fixture rebuilt the way the engine stores an event: starts_at is an instant, the repeat_* fields are the events columns.",
    "tz is the IANA zone the expansion runs in. skips are LOCAL dates in that zone. window is inclusive at both ends, in instants. expected is every occurrence in order, as LOCAL wall-clock date and time in tz (YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM); its first ten characters are the local date."
  ],
  "vectors": [
